20:["$","p",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Account plus container."}]," The default above. The endpoint is derived, and\nthe store authenticates with Entra ID Workload Identity and nothing else: it\nreads ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AZURE_TENANT_ID"}],", ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AZURE_CLIENT_ID"}]," and ",["$","code",null,{"children":"AZURE_FEDERATED_TOKEN_FILE"}],"\n(the variables AKS workload identity injects into a pod) and fails at startup\nif they are missing. A VM managed identity, a storage account key or an\n",["$","code",null,{"children":"az login"}]," session are not tried. Nothing secret is in the config."]}]
